sequenceDiagram
  actor Caller as Admin or timer
  participant T as gameticker wrapper
  participant O as Operation owner
  participant M as map_storage
  participant F as Generation files
  participant W as World and clients
  Caller->>T: savemap()
  T->>O: begin_persistence_operation(save)
  alt busy, dimension or recovery hold
    O-->>T: reject without replacing owner
  else admitted
    T->>M: run_world_operation(save, owner)
    M->>W: capture ownership / round / durable metadata
    M->>F: back up previous complete generation
    M->>F: invalidate active completion marker
    loop every z and turf
      M->>W: before_save_context / recursive changed fields
      M->>F: versioned typed entries and generation
      Note over M,W: Tick checks yield; not a universal atomic gameplay snapshot
    end
    M->>F: write round.json, then completion marker
    T->>O: finish(success) or cleanup and finish(failure)
  end
  Caller->>T: loadmap()
  T->>O: begin_persistence_operation(load)
  T->>M: prepare dimensions and validate all save structures
  alt preflight rejection
    T->>O: finish(false), no map clear
  else preflight accepted
    T->>W: mark mutation, suspend durable callbacks, ClearMap
    T->>M: run_world_operation(load, owner)
    M->>W: allocate all turfs, index, recursively restore
    M->>W: after_load, ownership registry, opacity and lights
    alt mutation/restoration failure
      T->>O: cleanup; latch recovery_required
    else restoration success
      T->>W: restore metadata, durable state, round phase and lighting
      T->>W: reclaim players unless restart transaction owns deferment
      T->>O: finish(true)
    end
  end
